      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. **Creation of Commission.** There is hereby established a commission to conduct a comprehensive review of the problem of homelessness and to make recommendations as to more efficient and effective responses to this crisis. The members shall be appointed by and serve at the pleasure of the Mayor. The Mayor shall designate a chairperson from among the members of the Commission so appointed.",
